(TITLE: Notice: White rice export ban from 5 December) Tj
T*
(SOURCE_NAME: Realm Trade Ministry) Tj
T*
(SOURCE_TYPE: gov_notice) Tj
T*
(RELIABILITY: 1) Tj
T*
(PUB_DATE: 2026-12-05) Tj
